                                                "sense_id": "0ca03958-5149-3ba2-849c-0a867b76027f",
                                                "text": "1994: Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, International Notes Human Plague -- India, 1994 - \"In particular, bubonic plague is characterized by painful swelling of lymph nodes (buboes) in the inguinal, axillary, or cervical regions.\""
